#: email.cpp:88
msgid "KDE Email Control Module"
msgstr "KDE Email kontrolni modul"

#: email.cpp:89
msgid "Configure your identity, email addresses, mail servers, etc."
msgstr "Podesite vaš identitet, e-mail adresu, mail servere itd."

#: email.cpp:91
msgid "Current maintainer"
msgstr "Trenutno održava"

#: email.cpp:185
msgid "New Email Profile"
msgstr "Novi email profil"

#: email.cpp:192
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "Puno ime:"

#: email.cpp:215
msgid "Oops, you need to enter a name please. Thanks."
msgstr "Ups, trebate unijeti puno ime i prezime. Hvala."

#: email.cpp:217
msgid "This email profile already exists, and cannot be created again"
msgstr "Takav email profil već postoji, pa ga nemožete ponovo napraviti."

#: email.cpp:217
msgid "Oops"
msgstr "Ups"

#: email.cpp:288
msgid ""
"<h1>email</h1> This module allows you to enter basic email information for "
"the current user. The information here is used, among other things, for "
"sending bug reports to the KDE developers when you use the bug report "
"dialog."
"<p>"
" Note that email programs like KMail and Empath offer many more features, "
"but they provide their own configuration facilities."
msgstr ""
"<h1>email</h1>"
" Ovaj modul vam omogućava unos osnovnih email podataka za trenutnog "
"korisnika. Podaci koji se unesu ovdje koriste se, između ostalog, za slanje "
"izvještaja o bugovima razvojnom timu KDE-a, kada koristite dijalog za prijavu "
"buga."
"<p> Obratite pažnju da email programi kao što su KMail i Empath nude mnogo "
"više mogućnosti, ali oni imaju vlastite prozore za podešavanje."

#: email.cpp:299 rc.cpp:13
msgid "Preferred Email Client"
msgstr "Omiljeni email program"

#: email.cpp:323
msgid "Do you wish to discard changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "Želite li odbaciti izmjene ovog profila?"

#: email.cpp:324
msgid "Do you wish to save changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "Želite li snimiti izmjene ovog profila?"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Elektronska pošta"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "C&urrent Profile:"
msgstr "&Trenutni profil:"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "&New Profile..."
msgstr "&Novi profil..."

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "User Information"
msgstr "Informacije o korisniku"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid ""
"You can set a reply address if you want replies to your email messages to go "
"to a different address than the email address above. Most likely, you should "
"leave the reply address blank, so replies go to the email address you "
"entered above."
"<p><em> Please note:</em> "
"<ul>"
"<li>You do not need to enter the same email address as above.</li>"
"<li>You should not use a reply address if you frequently use discussion "
"mailing lists.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje navedite adresu na koju želite primati odgovore, ako se ona razlikuje "
"od one na koju primate elektronsku poštu (email). Obično se koristi ista "
"adresa za primanje i slanje pošte, pa ako je to slučaj, ostavite mjesto za "
"povratnu adresu prazno. Odgovori će stizati na gore navedenu adresu. "
"<p><b> Napomena: </b> "
"<ul>"
"<li> Nije potrebno unositi istu adresu kao i ranije</li>"
"<li>"
" Ako često sudjelujete u raspravama preko mreže, bolje je ne koristiti "
"zasebnu povratnu adresu.</li></ul>"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"Enter your email address here, e.g. \"john@doe.com\" (without the quotation "
"marks). This information is mandatory if you want to use email.<p>\n"
"Do <em>not</em>"
" enter something like John Doe &lt;john@doe.com&gt;\", just a plain email "
"address. Your email address must not contain any blank spaces."
msgstr ""
"Unesite svoju email adresu ovdje, npr: \"mujo@suljic.ba\" (bez "
"navodnika). Obavezno je unijeti taj podatak ako želite koristiti email.<p>\n"
"<b>Nemojte</b> unositi adrese ako što su: \"Mujo Suljic "
"&lt;mujo@suljic.ba&gt;\". Samo obična email adresa, bez razmaka ili "
"sličnih znakova."

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "Organi&zation:"
msgstr "Or&ganizacija:"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "Reply-&To Address:"
msgstr "Adresa za &odgovor:"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Here you can enter the name of your organization, company or university. "
"This field is <em>optional</em>. However, if you are using a business "
"account and communicate with persons working for other companies, providing "
"the name of your organization is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete unijeti ime vašeg poduzeća/tvrtke/organizacije/sveučilišta "
"ili sl. Ovo polje <b>nije</b> nužno ispuniti. Ipak, ako koristite vaš službeni "
"ralun i komunicirate sa osobama koje rade za druge kompanije, preporučeno "
"je da navedete i naziv vaše organizacije."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "&Email Address:"
msgstr "E-mail &adresa:"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid ""
"Enter your full name here, e.g. \"John Doe\" (without the quotation\n"
"marks). Some people like to provide a nick name only. You can leave this "
"field blank and still use email. However, providing your full name is "
"<em>recommended</em> as this makes it much easier for your recipient to "
"browse his or her email."
msgstr ""
"Uvdje unesite svoje puno ime, npr. \"Mujo Suljić\"(bez navodnika)\n"
"Ako želite možete ovdje unijeti svoj nadimak ili ostaviti ovo polje "
"prazno. No, <b>ipak se preporučuje</b> budući da je tako lakše onome koji "
"čita vaše poruke."

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "&Full Name:"
msgstr "&Puno ime:"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid ""
"Enter the path to your preferred email client (KMail, Mutt, etc.) here or "
"choose it with the <em>Browse...</em> button. If no client is specified "
"here, KMail will be used (if available) instead.<p/> You can also use "
"several placeholders which will be replaced with the following "
"values:<p/>"
"<ul>"
"<li>%s: Subject</li>"
"<li>%c: Carbon Copy (CC)</li>"
"<li>%b: Blind Carbon Copy</li>"
"<li>%B: Body template</li><li>%t: Recipient's address</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje unesite putanju do vašeg programa za čitanje pošte (KMail, "
"Mutt,...) ili ga izaberite dugmetom <b>Potraži</b>. Ako nije naveden "
"nijedan program, onda se podrazumijeva da ćete koristiti KMail (ako "
"je instaliran).<p/> "
"Također možere korisiti razne umetke koji će biti zamjenjeni sa "
"sljedećim vrijednostima:<p/>"
"<ul>"
"<li>%s:Tema poruke</li>"
"<li>%c: Kopija (CC)</li>"
"<li>%b: Slijepa kopija (BCC)</li>"
"<li>%B: Predložak pisma</li><li>%t: Adresa primatelja</li></ul>"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid ""
"<ul> "
"<li>%t: Recipient's address</li> "
"<li>%s: Subject</li> "
"<li>%c: Carbon Copy (CC)</li> "
"<li>%b: Blind Carbon Copy (BCC)</li> "
"<li>%B: Template body text</li> <li>%A: Attachment </li> </ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul> "
"<li>%t: Adresa primatelja</li> "
"<li>%s: Tema poruke</li> "
"<li>%c: Kopija (CC)</li> "
"<li>%b: Slijepa kopija (BCC)</li> "
"<li>%B: Predložak pisma </li> <li>%A: Dodatak (attachment) </li> </ul>"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"Press this button to select your favorite email client. Please note that the "
"file you select has to have the executable attribute set in order to be "
"accepted."
"<br> You can also use several placeholders which will be replaced with the "
"actual values when the email client is called:"
"<ul> "
"<li>%t: Recipient's address</li> "
"<li>%s: Subject</li> "
"<li>%c: Carbon Copy (CC)</li> "
"<li>%b: Blind Carbon Copy (BCC)</li> "
"<li>%B: Template body text</li> <li>%A: Attachment </li> </ul>"
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite ovo dugme za biranje vašeg omiljenog email programa. Pazite da "
"datoteku koju odaberete morate moći izvršiti (tj. da imate privilegije za "
"izvršenje). "
"<br>Također možete koristiti kodove u komandnoj liniji koji će biti zamjenjeni "
"odgovarajućim vrijednostima kada pozovete e-mail program: "
"<ul> "
"<li>%t: Adresa primatelja</li> "
"<li>%s: Tema poruke</li> "
"<li>%c: Kopija (CC)</li> "
"<li>%b: Slijepa kopija (BCC)</li> "
"<li>%B: Predložak pisma</li> <li>%A: Dodatak (attachment) </li> </ul>"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "&Run In Terminal"
msgstr "Pokreni u &terminalu"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid ""
"Activate this option if you want the selected email client to be executed in "
"a terminal (e.g. <em>Konsole</em>)."
msgstr ""
"Uključite ovu opciju ako želite da se odabrani email klijent pokreće u terminalu (npr. "
"<em>Konzola</em>)."

